Sven Giegold, Daniel Freund, Terry Reintke, Alice Kuhnke, Gwendoline Delbos‑Corfield, Bronis Ropė, Henrike Hahn, Tineke Strik, Saskia Bricmont, Viola Von Cramon‑Taubadel, Erik Marquardt, Diana Riba i Giner  
