), 

– having regard to the Commission communication of 19 October 2021 entitled ‘2021 Communication on EU Enlargement Policy’ ([COM(2021)0644](https://eur-lex.europa.eu/smartapi/cgi/sga_doc?smartapi!celexplus!prod!DocNumber&lg=EN&type_doc=COMfinal&an_doc=2021&nu_doc=0644)
), accompanied by the Commission staff working document entitled ‘Albania 2021 Report’ (SWD(2021)0289),

