on the proposal for a Council directive amending Directive 2006/112/EC as regards VAT rules for the digital age

([COM(2022)0701](https://eur-lex.europa.eu/smartapi/cgi/sga_doc?smartapi!celexplus!prod!DocNumber&lg=EN&type_doc=COMfinal&an_doc=2022&nu_doc=0701)

– C9‑0021/2023 – [2022/0407(CNS)](https://oeil.secure.europarl.europa.eu/oeil/popups/ficheprocedure.do?lang=en&reference=2022/0407(CNS))
)

(Special legislative procedure – consultation)

The European Parliament,

– having regard to the Commission proposal to the Council ([COM(2022)0701](https://eur-lex.europa.eu/smartapi/cgi/sga_doc?smartapi!celexplus!prod!DocNumber&lg=EN&type_doc=COMfinal&an_doc=2022&nu_doc=0701)),

– having regard to Article 113 of the Treaty on the Functioning of the European Union, pursuant to which the Council consulted Parliament (C9‑0021/2023),

